-- CLASS OR STRUCT KEYWORD -------------------------------------- main.kl  K0920

`class`, `struct`, `record` and `interface` come from other languages. Kalam declares a record type with `type` and an interface with `trait`.

1│ class Point:
   ^^^^^

Try: `type`

Help: Write `type Name:` with one `field: Type` per indented line, or `trait Name:` for an interface. `kalam fix` rewrites the keyword.

Learn more: kalam explain K0920
